class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-25rem"><div class="icon-background"><div class="c text-color-white w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--ic" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M16.24 13.65c-1.17-.52-2.61-.9-4.24-.9s-3.07.39-4.24.9A2.99 2.99 0 0 0 6 16.39V18h12v-1.61c0-1.18-.68-2.26-1.76-2.74m-15.02.93A2.01 2.01 0 0 0 0 16.43V18h4.5v-1.61c0-.83.23-1.61.63-2.29c-.37-.06-.74-.1-1.13-.1c-.99 0-1.93.21-2.78.58m21.56 0A6.95 6.95 0 0 0 20 14c-.39 0-.76.04-1.13.1c.4.68.63 1.46.63 2.29V18H24v-1.57c0-.81-.48-1.53-1.22-1.85M12 12c1.66 0 3-1.34 3-3s-1.34-3-3-3s-3 1.34-3 3s1.34 3 3 3M1.497 11L4 8.497L6.503 11L4 13.503zM20 9l-2.5 4h5z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="flex-v-left-top gap--25rem"><h3 class="heading-style-h4 text-color-violet">Employee Groups</h3><div class="text-size-small homepage">Build ERGs that scale globally, mobilize members around shared causes and tie participation to business outcomes.</div></div></div><div class="button is-icon-black-transparent text-color-violet">Learn about Employee Groups →</div></div></a></div><div class="homepage-feature-card"><a href="/products/challenges" class="card-background w-inline-block"><div class="module-feature-wrapper gap-1rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-25rem"><div class="icon-background purple"><div class="c text-color-white w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--bx" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 4h-3V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3c0 4.31 1.8 6.91 4.82 7A6 6 0 0 0 11 17.91V20H9v2h6v-2h-2v-2.09A6 6 0 0 0 17.18 15c3-.1 4.82-2.7 4.82-7V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1zM4 8V6h2v6.83C4.22 12.08 4 9.3 4 8zm14 4.83V6h2v2c0 1.3-.22 4.08-2 4.83z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div><div class="flex-v-left-top gap--25rem"><h3 class="heading-style-h4 text-color-violet">Challenges</h3><div class="text-size-small homepage">Drive behavior change and build culture through gamified experiences that connect purpose to everyday employee life.</div></div></div><div class="button is-icon-black-transparent text-color-violet">Learn about Challenges →</div></div></a></div><div class="homepage-feature-card"><a href="/products/reporting-suite" class="card-background w-inline-block"><div class="module-feature-wrapper gap-1rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-25rem"><div class="icon-background blue"><div class="c text-color-white w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--bx" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3 3v17a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h17v-2H5V3z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.293 14.707a1 1 0 0 0 1.414 0l5-5l-1.414-1.414L16 12.586l-2.293-2.293a1 1 0 0 0-1.414 0l-5 5l1.414 1.414L13 12.414z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="flex-v-left-top gap--25rem"><h3 class="heading-style-h4 text-color-violet">Reporting Suite</h3><div class="text-size-small homepage">Consolidate everything into a single Trusted Impact number — the aggregate dollar value of every hour, dollar and action.</div></div></div><div class="button is-icon-black-transparent text-color-violet">Learn about Reporting →</div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="background-color-moonshot"><div><div class="padding-global padding-section-xlarge"><div class="container-large"><div class="grid-2x-equal gap-large-4rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div><div class="eyebrow-wrapper"><div class="eyebrow text-color-aqua">AI-native purpose platform</div></div><h2>Built for what&#x27;s next.<br/>‍<span class="text-color-aqua">AI-first social impact.</span></h2></div><div class="text-size-medium">Benevity&#x27;s foundation has been refined for nearly two decades including regulatory compliance, secure payments, continuous nonprofit validation.<br/><br/>Now it is evolving into an AI-native platform. Not features bolted on. Intelligence embedded from the ground up. Our AI governance framework is grounded in integrity, fairness and accountability. Not added as an afterthought.</div><div class="demo-testimonial alt-background"><br/><blockquote class="text-style-quote-alt text-color-white">&quot;Reviewing employee match requests used to take me 3–5 hours a week. Using Match Assurance brought that down to about two hours - cutting my workflow in half.&quot;</blockquote><cite class="text-size-small text-weight-semibold">Anthony Rodriguez, Global Responsibility Lead, Starbucks</cite></div><div class="button-group margin-top"><a href="/solutions/ai-csr-platform" class="button w-button">See AI capabilities</a><a href="/legal/responsible-ai-policy" class="button is-icon-white-transparent w-button">Read our Responsible AI policy →</a></div></div></div><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-25rem"><div class="features-card"><div class="flex-h-left-top gap-16px"><div><div class="c w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--ic" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19.5 3.5L18 2l-1.5 1.5L15 2l-1.5 1.5L12 2l-1.5 1.5L9 2L7.5 3.5L6 2v14H3v3c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3h12c1.66 0 3-1.34 3-3V2zM15 20H6c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-1h10zm4-1c0 .55-.45 1-1 1s-1-.45-1-1v-3H8V5h11z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 7h6v2H9zm0 3h6v2H9zm7-3h2v2h-2zm0 3h2v2h-2z"></path></svg></div></div><div><div class="flex-h-left-center"><h3 class="heading-style-h6">Match Assurance</h3><div class="live-highlight"><div>Live</div></div></div><div class="text-size-small homepage">Extracts key info from uploaded receipts automatically — before it reaches a program admin. Time saved. Every transaction. </div></div></div></div><div class="features-card"><div class="flex-h-left-top gap-16px"><div><div class="icon-embed-xsmall w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--simple-icons" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.986 23.972C5.411 23.972 0 18.561 0 11.986C0 5.411 5.411 0 11.986 0c6.575 0 11.986 5.411 11.986 11.986a11.9 11.9 0 0 1-2.492 7.281l2.062 2.062c.293.293.458.691.458 1.106c0 .859-.706 1.565-1.565 1.565c-.415 0-.813-.165-1.106-.458l-2.062-2.062a11.9 11.9 0 0 1-7.281 2.492Zm6.664-6.001a8.936 8.936 0 0 0 2.31-5.985c0-4.923-4.051-8.974-8.974-8.974c-2.702 0-5.141 1.22-6.792 3.135h5.255v2.458H3.681a8.851 8.851 0 0 0-.536 1.844H9.22v2.459H3.06c.087.845.297 1.673.621 2.459h4.31v2.458H5.194c1.651 1.915 4.09 3.135 6.792 3.135c2.29 0 4.392-.877 5.985-2.31a1.59 1.59 0 0 1 .679-.679Zm-9.43-.146h7.376v-2.458H9.22v2.458Zm6.147-4.917h4.917v-2.459h-4.917v2.459Zm-4.918 0h3.074v-2.459h-3.074v2.459Zm1.844-4.303h4.918V6.147h-4.918v2.458Z"></path></svg></div></div><div><div class="flex-h-left-center"><h3 class="heading-style-h6">AI Grant Summaries</h3><div class="live-highlight"><div>Live</div></div></div><div class="text-size-small homepage">Generative AI produces a structured overview of every grant application — purpose, funding needs, intended impact. Review in minutes, not hours.</div></div></div></div><div class="features-card"><div class="flex-h-left-top gap-16px"><div><div class="icon-embed-xsmall w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--ic" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M17 6H7c-3.31 0-6 2.69-6 6s2.69 6 6 6h10c3.31 0 6-2.69 6-6s-2.69-6-6-6m0 10H7c-2.21 0-4-1.79-4-4s1.79-4 4-4h10c2.21 0 4 1.79 4 4s-1.79 4-4 4m0-7c-1.66 0-3 1.34-3 3s1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3s-1.34-3-3-3"></path></svg></div></div><div><div class="flex-h-left-center"><h3 class="heading-style-h6">Total Governance</h3><div class="live-highlight purple"><div>Always On</div></div></div><div class="text-size-small homepage">Complete control over your AI experience — full transparency into what AI does, with the ability to opt out of any usage in the platform.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="background-color-tint-1"><div class="padding-global padding-section-large-copy"><div class="container-large"><div class="grid-2x-equal gap-large-4rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div><div class="eyebrow-wrapper"><div class="eyebrow eyebrow-color-blue">Global Money Movement</div></div><h2 class="heading-style-h3 larger-mobile">99% payment success.<br/>200+ countries.<br/>One platform.</h2></div><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-medium"><div class="text-size-small homepage">Benevity disburses funds globally with speed, security, and compliance — in local currencies, with full tax reconciliation handled. Your program&#x27;s reach is never limited by where your team has bandwidth.</div><ul role="list" class="text-size-small homepage no-margin"><li>Continuous nonprofit validation across 2.5 million organizations</li><li>Intelligent fraud detection on every transaction</li><li>Automated sanctions, tax, and governance compliance</li><li>Single audit trail — one vendor, one contract, no year-end scramble</li></ul><div class="text-size-small homepage highlight-violet">$100,000 <strong>average annual tax savings per client</strong></div></div><div class="button-group"><a href="/solutions/money-movement" class="button w-button">See how money movement works</a></div></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab165dfcfef2a96d74254e1_MoneyMovement-WIP.avif" loading="lazy" width="832" height="552" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab165dfcfef2a96d74254e1_MoneyMovement-WIP-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab165dfcfef2a96d74254e1_MoneyMovement-WIP-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab165dfcfef2a96d74254e1_MoneyMovement-WIP-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab165dfcfef2a96d74254e1_MoneyMovement-WIP.avif 1664w" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 832px"/></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="padding-global padding-section-large-copy"><div class="container-large"><div class="grid-2x-equal gap-large-4rem"><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab1666e7205874e46ac0626_EmployeeMobilization.avif" loading="lazy" width="832" height="553" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab1666e7205874e46ac0626_EmployeeMobilization-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab1666e7205874e46ac0626_EmployeeMobilization-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab1666e7205874e46ac0626_EmployeeMobilization-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab1666e7205874e46ac0626_EmployeeMobilization.avif 1664w" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 832px"/></div><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div><div class="eyebrow-wrapper"><div class="eyebrow eyebrow-color-blue">Employee Mobilization</div></div><h2 class="heading-style-h3 larger-mobile">Every employee.<br/>Every location.<br/>One unified program.</h2></div><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-medium"><div class="text-size-small homepage">Benevity makes it easy for every employee to take action, whether they work at headquarters, in the field, remotely or without a desk. Purpose doesn&#x27;t stop at the office door, and neither does your program.</div><ul role="list" class="text-size-small homepage no-margin"><li>Mobile-first experience for deskless and remote employees</li><li>ERG tools that connect cause to culture, globally</li><li>Gamified challenges that drive daily engagement</li></ul><div class="text-size-small homepage highlight-violet">27% average increase in employee participation</div></div><div class="button-group"><a href="/solutions/employee-mobilization" class="button w-button">Learn about employee mobilization</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="background-color-tint-1"><div class="padding-global padding-section-large-copy"><div class="container-large"><div class="grid-2x-equal gap-large-4rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div><div class="eyebrow-wrapper"><div class="eyebrow eyebrow-color-blue">CSR and Grant Risk Mitigation</div></div><h2 class="heading-style-h3 larger-mobile">The crises that don&#x27;t happen are the proof that matters most</h2></div><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-medium"><div class="text-size-small homepage">Benevity continuously validates nonprofits, runs intelligent fraud detection on every transaction, and automates adherence to sanctions, tax regulations, and governance standards in every market you operate.</div><ul role="list" class="text-size-small homepage no-margin"><li>Centralized audit trail — always audit-ready</li><li>Sanctions screening and regulatory compliance, automated</li><li>Match Assurance flags anomalies before they become fraud</li></ul><div class="text-size-small homepage highlight-violet">2.5M nonprofits continuously validated, globally</div></div><div class="button-group"><a href="/solutions/grantmaking-csr-risk-mitigation" class="button w-button">Learn about risk mitigation</a></div></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab16659b3423b4b02e022c6_RiskMitigation-WIP.avif" loading="lazy" width="832" height="555" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab16659b3423b4b02e022c6_RiskMitigation-WIP-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab16659b3423b4b02e022c6_RiskMitigation-WIP-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab16659b3423b4b02e022c6_RiskMitigation-WIP-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680946676a0dac031a9848fc/6ab16659b3423b4b02e022c6_RiskMitigation-WIP.avif 1664w" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 832px"/></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="padding-global padding-section-large-copy"><div class="container-large"><div class="global-heading-medium-container"><div class="eyebrow-wrapper"><div class="eyebrow eyebrow-color-blue">Why Benevity</div></div><div class="global-heading-copy-wrapper margin-bottom margin-large"><div class="text-color-primary"><h2 class="heading-style-h2">One platform.<br/>Proven outcomes. Global impact.</h2></div><div class="global-heading-copy-text-container"><div class="text-size-medium">Benevity helps leading companies connect employee giving, volunteering and grants programs to business outcomes that matter.</div></div></div></div><div><div class="grid-2x-40-60 gap-large-4rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div class="divider-standard margin-bottom-only"></div><div class="flex-h-left-top gap-8px"><div><div class="text-style-numbers homepage">01</div></div><div><h3 class="heading-style-h5">One audit trail, not three.</h3><div class="text-size-small homepage">Every dollar, every hour, every grant — all in one system your CFO, legal team and board can trust. No reconciling across platforms at year-end.</div></div></div><div class="divider-standard margin-bottom-only"></div><div class="flex-h-left-top gap-8px"><div><div class="text-style-numbers homepage">02</div></div><div><h3 class="heading-style-h5"><strong>Faster disbursements. Fewer escalations.</strong></h3><div class="text-size-small homepage">Our disbursement engine automates routing, compliance checks, currency conversion and receipting — so funds move faster.</div></div></div><div class="divider-standard margin-bottom-only"></div><div class="flex-h-left-top gap-8px"><div><div class="text-style-numbers homepage">03</div></div><div><h3 class="heading-style-h5"><strong>The proof to win any room.</strong></h3><div class="text-size-small homepage">Trusted Impact reporting gives you a single number — every dollar, hour and action, translated into the language finance, legal and the C-suite can act on.</div></div></div></div><div class="button-group margin-top margin-small"><a href="/benevity-advantage" class="button w-button">Learn more about the Benevity Advantage</a></div></div><div><code-island data-loader="{&quot;tag&quot;:&quot;FEDERATION&quot;,&quot;val&quot;:{&quot;clientModuleUrl&quot;:&quot;https://code-components.website-files.com/6ae0b4472a4cecbd5ca3c210%2Fmodule%2Fwf-manifest.json&quot;,&quot;moduleId&quot;:&quot;_6ae0b4472a4cecbd5ca3c210&quot;,&quot;submoduleId&quot;:&quot;a96d4787-3955-50bb-f13a-ceec6e92ebd6&quot;,&quot;exportPath&quot;:&quot;default&quot;,&quot;serverModuleUrl&quot;:&quot;_&quot;}}" data-props="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Benevity vs. Point Solutions&quot;,&quot;columnA&quot;:&quot;Benevity&quot;,&quot;columnB&quot;:&quot;Point Solution&quot;,&quot;row1&quot;:&quot;Unified reporting across giving, volunteering &amp; grants&quot;,&quot;row1A&quot;:true,&quot;row1B&quot;:false,&quot;showRow1&quot;:true,&quot;row2&quot;:&quot;Global money movement, 200+ countries&quot;,&quot;row2A&quot;:true,&quot;row2B&quot;:false,&quot;showRow2&quot;:true,&quot;row3&quot;:&quot;99% payment success rate&quot;,&quot;row3A&quot;:true,&quot;row3B&quot;:false,&quot;showRow3&quot;:true,&quot;row4&quot;:&quot;Continuous nonprofit validation, 312K+&quot;,&quot;r