e-medium">From the 2025 Benevity client survey — what teams say their program actually does for the business.</div></div></div></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="grid-3x-equal _1-column-mobile"><div class="state-feature-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-style-h1 text-color-violet">92%</h3><div class="text-size-medium">of clients say Benevity has had a positive effect on business efficiency</div></div><div class="state-feature-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-style-h1 text-color-light-blue">75%</h3><div class="text-size-medium">say Benevity helps them build a stronger, more connected culture</div></div><div class="state-feature-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-style-h1 text-color-aqua darker">82%</h3><div class="text-size-medium">say Benevity helps their company live its corporate values</div></div></div></div><div class="button-group margin-top margin-small"><a href="/client-stories" class="button w-button">Read client stories </a></div></div></div></section><div class="background-color-violet"><div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large"><div class="grid-2x-equal gap-large-4rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem"><div class="flex-v-left-top gap-1-75rem text-color-white"><div><h2 class="heading-style-h2 text-color-alternate">Your program is more powerful than anyone in that room knows.</h2></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_3c5233fd-956e-ac8c-e57d-29205d1ae505-1a9848fb" class="flex-v-left-top gap-medium"><div class="text-size-medium text-color-white">Let&#x27;s change that. See how the world&#x27;s most purpose-driven companies use Benevity to protect, prove and grow their programs — and walk into every conversation with the proof already made.</div><div class="button-group"><a href="/demo-enterprise-impact-platform" class="button w-button">Get a personalized demo</a><a href="/interactive-demo" class="button is-icon-white-transparent w-button">Watch an interactive demo  →</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="footer-section"><div class="padding-global padding-section-large"><div class="container-large"><div class="text-size-medium"><div class="footer-layout_grid"><div class="footer-grid-left_col"><a aria-label="Benevity home" href="/" aria-current="page" class="w-inline-block w--current"><div class="w-embed"><svg width="100%" id="Layer_1" class="white footer-logo" viewBox="0 0 180 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
